id: DRAFT-libnih-1.0.3-ndebug-assert-sideeffect-hoist
trigger_tool: make|conan
phase: testing
error_signature: conflicting types for .*_marshal|duplicate symbol[: ]+output_package|redefinition of 'sockaddr_storage'
severity: 3
category: autotools, testing, build-system, portability, libc, musl, ohos
match_keywords: ndebug, duplicate symbol, sockaddr_storage
title: Release -DNDEBUG吞掉assert副作用致autotools代码生成器签名漂移的外移修复
root_cause: Release默认-DNDEBUG把assert编译为空而上游把type_to_const与nih_strdup等副作用写在assert内导致生成点c签名与签入头const不一致
affected_scope: SHOULD_NOT_HAVE_LEADING_SPACE
verification_cmd: 真机保留make check编译报错与HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT实计数41项全编出后按PASS与FAIL如实上报
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: assert-side-effect-hoist
rec_description: 将生成器assert内副作用移出无条件执行后仅用assert校验结果并同步修正indent指针类型与-fcommon与socket守卫与install-sh绕行
rec_command: archives/l/libnih/1.0.3/conanfile.py新增_fix_factory_ndebug改nih-dbus-tool生成器共4处加generate加tc.extra_cflags加-fcommon加source直改nih/tests/test_io.c加_patch_install_sh遍历Makefile改INSTALL为install-sh
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-source-fix
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: per-binary-isolate-honest-report
fallback_description: 任一失败目录逐二进制15秒隔离并按HUNG记environment与FAIL记ohos_feature分项记gaps缺口全覆盖时只警告不硬失败
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"discovered":28[^}]*"status":"passed"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止生成器签名未修复时以28对41残缺口径放行须41全部编出后按实计数上报
forbid_1_consequence: 真机make check仍报conflicting types任务退回修复循环
